<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Kolon Const H1 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Kolon Const H1 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		  139    vs	130</p>
<p>    Net			 1.54    vs     1.03</p>
<p>    Profit before tax     1.69    vs     1.03</p>
<p>    Turnover		277.47    vs   211.59</p>
<p>Note - Kolon Construction Co Ltd is a construction unit of the Kolon Group, South Korea's 20th largest conglomerate. The Korea Listed Companies Association provided the figures but gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
